{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2968540/extras/def951f5b3766caa7c55ba2d6abfe13c.avif?t=1772419387\" width=1526 height=130 /></span><strong><u>GAME MODES:</u></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u25ef Hive Survival \u25ef Escape \u25ef Football \u25ef Elimination Run\u00a0\u25ef Arena</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2968540/extras/aff1530a5e079862cbbfc22749ec0d2d.poster.avif?t=1772419387\" width=720 height=320 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2968540/extras/aff1530a5e079862cbbfc22749ec0d2d.webm?t=1772419387\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>CHOOMBY</strong> is an online game about the adventures and rivalry of insects. The game mode depends on the chosen map. The Spider won\u2019t leave you alone and blocks your freedom to fly wherever you want. Collect pollen and build a base that can strike back at the Spider!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2968540/extras/b9e3f85a1279eddb4f296381dfb8e4c9.webp?t=1772419387\" width=629 height=39 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>The main feature</strong> \u2014 <strong>one strong player faces off against many weaker ones</strong>. To defeat the powerful, the weak must work together and take on different roles.</h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >In addition, thanks to a variety of maps and modes, you can play <strong>tag with infection</strong>, explore <strong>mazes and traps</strong>, compete in <strong>football matches</strong>, enjoy <strong>elimination mini-games</strong>, or take part in <strong>base capture battles (PvP / PvPvE)</strong>. <br> <br> <u>Peculiarities:</u> \u00a0 \u00a0 <br>\u00a0- Adventure  <br>\u00a0- Feel like an insect  <br>\u00a0- Base construction  <br>\u00a0- Various game modes  <br>\u00a0- Asymmetrical multiplayer</h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\">  <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2968540/extras/b9e3f85a1279eddb4f296381dfb8e4c9.webp?t=1772419387\" width=629 height=39 /></span>  </h2>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2968540?t=1772419387","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2968540/b9408b1c0d8aacac1026dc68ae1fcfcd5b6a92a0/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1772419387","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2968540/4b960bf9952f3476b29c1800578ad73f2823081a/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1772419387","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2968540/4b960bf9952f3476b29c1800578ad73f2823081a/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1772419387","categories":[{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"PvP","id":49},{"description":"Online PvP","id":36},{"description":"Co-op","id":9},{"description":"Online Co-op","id":38},{"description":"LAN Co-op","id":48},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2968540/extras/def951f5b3766caa7c55ba2d6abfe13c.avif?t=1772419387\" width=1526 height=130 /></span><strong><u>GAME MODES:</u></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u25ef Hive Survival \u25ef Escape \u25ef Football \u25ef Elimination Run\u00a0\u25ef Arena</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span clas